<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post406886952460947306..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: Ruby Ridge: The Age of State Terrorism Begins</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/406886952460947306/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/ruby-ridge-age-of-state-terrorism-begins.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>22</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8187515712982094350</id><published>2016-11-02T05:19:45.386-06:00</published><updated>2016-11-02T05:19:45.386-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Good article, thank you! I didn&amp;#39;t know details...</title><content type='html'>Good article, thank you! I didn&amp;#39;t know details of the Ruby Ridge story.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/406886952460947306/comments/default/8187515712982094350'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/406886952460947306/comments/default/8187515712982094350'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/ruby-ridge-age-of-state-terrorism-begins.html?showComment=1478085585386#c8187515712982094350' title=''/><author><name>Rem870</name><uri>http://www.rem870.com</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/ruby-ridge-age-of-state-terrorism-begins.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-406886952460947306' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/406886952460947306' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2062314654"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 2, 2016 at 5:19 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1534204569029355873</id><published>2012-12-26T14:06:14.191-07:00</published><updated>2012-12-26T14:06:14.191-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Wow this shit you can&amp;#39;t make in tv or games. W...</title><content type='html'>Wow this shit you can&amp;#39;t make in tv or games. Whoever said the truth is stranger that fiction called it right.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;To think the FBI did something like this all under the guise of &amp;quot;law enforcement&amp;quot; at least the KGB despite there brutality were not hypocrites unlike the FBI.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I feel sad for victims there families and especially for honest FBI agents there swimming in a sea of shit with no way out other than leave agency or become the villain</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/406886952460947306/comments/default/1534204569029355873'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/406886952460947306/comments/default/1534204569029355873'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/ruby-ridge-age-of-state-terrorism-begins.html?showComment=1356555974191#c1534204569029355873' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/ruby-ridge-age-of-state-terrorism-begins.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-406886952460947306' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/406886952460947306' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-400899558"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 26, 2012 at 2:06 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-762147865175352978</id><published>2012-10-29T23:42:39.993-06:00</published><updated>2012-10-29T23:42:39.993-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I remember Ruby Ridge.</title><content type='html'>I remember Ruby Ridge.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/406886952460947306/comments/default/762147865175352978'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/406886952460947306/comments/default/762147865175352978'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/ruby-ridge-age-of-state-terrorism-begins.html?showComment=1351575759993#c762147865175352978' title=''/><author><name>Mr. Mcgranor</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/12851136550476241757</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='http://4.bp.blogspot.com/-BYbvMXWKgFs/TWRwMaVUxNI/AAAAAAAAABk/-Djx96ZKJvc/s220/150_964816-0.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/ruby-ridge-age-of-state-terrorism-begins.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-406886952460947306' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/406886952460947306' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1659259730"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 29, 2012 at 11:42 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4380848791104928014</id><published>2012-08-31T11:30:28.168-06:00</published><updated>2012-08-31T11:30:28.168-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I know which side I would choose. I do so everyday...</title><content type='html'>I know which side I would choose. I do so everyday, and I am villified for it. I&amp;#39;ll never be promoted. I&amp;#39;ve been thrown to wolves and had back up arrive late and then taken myself to the hospital later.  Nobody rushes to help me anymore. And yet I still believe in what I do.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I choose long ago, and even if I were to change my mind now, the thin blue line won&amp;#39;t protect what they see as a traitor.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I really am on your side. You don&amp;#39;t need to believe me, I&amp;#39;ll still help you if I am able.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/406886952460947306/comments/default/4380848791104928014'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/406886952460947306/comments/default/4380848791104928014'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/ruby-ridge-age-of-state-terrorism-begins.html?showComment=1346434228168#c4380848791104928014' title=''/><author><name>Professor James Moriarty</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/07998043021546485959</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/ruby-ridge-age-of-state-terrorism-begins.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-406886952460947306' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/406886952460947306' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1617175361"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 31, 2012 at 11:30 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6266680665761846400</id><published>2012-08-30T18:03:02.492-06:00</published><updated>2012-08-30T18:03:02.492-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Moriarity:&#xa;&#xa;Arguments and fistfights, eh? I guess ...</title><content type='html'>Moriarity:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Arguments and fistfights, eh? I guess you feel vindicated for writing that,&lt;br /&gt; but when the People finally awake, recognize that the overwhelming &lt;br /&gt;majority of those on YOUR side of the &amp;quot;thin blue line&amp;quot; are their staunch &lt;br /&gt;adversaries, oppressors and servants of their Enemy, and come after &lt;br /&gt;them with malicious intent, which side will you choose, I wonder? &lt;br /&gt;Unfortunately, I&amp;#39;m confident that I already know the answer, but it is &lt;br /&gt;sometimes comforting, if fallacious, to pretend that any member of &lt;br /&gt;the oppressor class is salvagable...</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/406886952460947306/comments/default/6266680665761846400'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/406886952460947306/comments/default/6266680665761846400'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/ruby-ridge-age-of-state-terrorism-begins.html?showComment=1346371382492#c6266680665761846400' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/ruby-ridge-age-of-state-terrorism-begins.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-406886952460947306' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/406886952460947306' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-823531434"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 30, 2012 at 6:03 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3124912928015833031</id><published>2012-08-27T16:19:39.141-06:00</published><updated>2012-08-27T16:19:39.141-06:00</updated><title type='text'>For some reason, Mr. Horiuchi has never returned t...</title><content type='html'>For some reason, Mr. Horiuchi has never returned to the State of Idaho since the Ruby Ridge incident.  I wonder why that might be...</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/406886952460947306/comments/default/3124912928015833031'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/406886952460947306/comments/default/3124912928015833031'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/ruby-ridge-age-of-state-terrorism-begins.html?showComment=1346105979141#c3124912928015833031' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/ruby-ridge-age-of-state-terrorism-begins.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-406886952460947306' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/406886952460947306' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-943955295"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 27, 2012 at 4:19 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-89510237420023638</id><published>2012-08-27T12:01:58.805-06:00</published><updated>2012-08-27T12:01:58.805-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Another in a long line of outstanding posts, Will....</title><content type='html'>Another in a long line of outstanding posts, Will.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;What happened at Ruby Ridge, unfortunately, has become minor in light of what has happened over the past 20 years in Amerika.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/406886952460947306/comments/default/89510237420023638'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/406886952460947306/comments/default/89510237420023638'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/ruby-ridge-age-of-state-terrorism-begins.html?showComment=1346090518805#c89510237420023638' title=''/><author><name>Bob</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/16565620274260288512</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='31' height='13' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_DJFdiJYKX2Y/R-VWHCcM2qI/AAAAAAAAATk/Tgw6srrhKx0/S220/TerryToons+02.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/ruby-ridge-age-of-state-terrorism-begins.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-406886952460947306' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/406886952460947306' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-758129297"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 27, 2012 at 12:01 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5790347461604670116</id><published>2012-08-26T14:12:06.666-06:00</published><updated>2012-08-26T14:12:06.666-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Thanks for great articles.&#xa;&#xa;Scary and sad how quic...</title><content type='html'>Thanks for great articles.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Scary and sad how quickly our U.S. has accelerated into the classic police state. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Government was evil enough during days of Janet Reno&amp;#39;s Ruby Ridge; but now, just look at how much worse things have become with Janet Napolitano&amp;#39;s near total surveillance via Internet, drones, etc.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Younger generation is in for a truly disappointing future -- especially when their Orwellian existence becomes compared to an earlier era.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Hopefully, information from writers like yourself will be helpful.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/406886952460947306/comments/default/5790347461604670116'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/406886952460947306/comments/default/5790347461604670116'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/ruby-ridge-age-of-state-terrorism-begins.html?showComment=1346011926666#c5790347461604670116' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/ruby-ridge-age-of-state-terrorism-begins.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-406886952460947306' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/406886952460947306' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1177642477"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 26, 2012 at 2:12 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7385594055263748575</id><published>2012-08-25T13:26:30.654-06:00</published><updated>2012-08-25T13:26:30.654-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Hm.  Who is the current Boundary County, Idaho, DA...</title><content type='html'>Hm.  Who is the current Boundary County, Idaho, DA?  Is it possible to set up a fund for the purpose of prosecuting Horiuchi?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/406886952460947306/comments/default/7385594055263748575'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/406886952460947306/comments/default/7385594055263748575'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/ruby-ridge-age-of-state-terrorism-begins.html?showComment=1345922790654#c7385594055263748575' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/ruby-ridge-age-of-state-terrorism-begins.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-406886952460947306' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/406886952460947306' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-555362128"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 25, 2012 at 1:26 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8307946527109269018</id><published>2012-08-25T12:39:41.669-06:00</published><updated>2012-08-25T12:39:41.669-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Another great piece Will.  This one really hit a n...</title><content type='html'>Another great piece Will.  This one really hit a nerve as these are the exact things that first caused me to start questioning everything i heard from the government.  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;A Detroit Talk Radio host Mark Scott, who I became an occasional cigar smoking buddy with at a cigar shop across from my office, was all over all these things as they were happening and had all documentation of all the connections leading back to government operations. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;We talked for hours about what had really happened at OKC and who really was running the show.   &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Thanks for refreshing my old brain cells with the reason I am who I am today. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/406886952460947306/comments/default/8307946527109269018'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/406886952460947306/comments/default/8307946527109269018'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/ruby-ridge-age-of-state-terrorism-begins.html?showComment=1345919981669#c8307946527109269018' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/ruby-ridge-age-of-state-terrorism-begins.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-406886952460947306' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/406886952460947306' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-323015691"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 25, 2012 at 12:39 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2750784841109809386</id><published>2012-08-25T07:57:39.798-06:00</published><updated>2012-08-25T07:57:39.798-06:00</updated><title type='text'>One grammatical quibble:&#xa;&#xa;&amp;quot;...Neither  Horiuc...</title><content type='html'>One grammatical quibble:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;...Neither  Horiuchi nor his supervisors, Larry Potts and Danny Coulson, were never prosecuted.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Correction: Ever prosecuted.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;By the way, I am a LEO who works for the State of New York. I have become a regular reader here and appreciate your work.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;There are LEO&amp;#39;s on your side and the public&amp;#39;s. But they are becoming a shrinking majority. It&amp;#39;s hard for us to combat the fascists among us when the federal, state and local money favors the fascists.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;If you haven&amp;#39;t ever read or recommended them, I suggest looking up &amp;quot;Don&amp;#39;t talk to the police&amp;quot; on YouTube and also check out the videos at Flex Your Rights.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Some of us still hold the Constitution above all, still fight about it in the patrol cars and locker rooms, and even get into fistfights about it. But like I said, we are shrinking in number.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I wanted to get out of Law Enforcement but my wife said we can do better by sticking with it and fighting from the inside.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The best advice I can give is record everything with your phone (possibly the greatest equalizer since the Peacemaker, though it&amp;#39;s good to have one of those too. And a .308).&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Keep up the fight&lt;br /&gt;Molon Labe</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/406886952460947306/comment