ngs Will. My only sugge...</title><content type='html'>Hard to say enough good things Will. My only suggestion would have been to add  the horrific way the the FBI murdered Gordon Kahl.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://www.constitution.org/abus/gkahl/kahl.htm </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/406886952460947306/comments/default/5779302113671639669'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/406886952460947306/comments/default/5779302113671639669'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/ruby-ridge-age-of-state-terrorism-begins.html?showComment=1345868904843#c5779302113671639669' title=''/><author><name>InalienableWrights</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/02108700971976990644</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='21' src='http://1.bp.blogspot.com/_MknTgiDcOKU/Sbq4HYqLYUI/AAAAAAAAEok/Gy3CCv4L1xI/S220/constitution.JPG'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/ruby-ridge-age-of-state-terrorism-begins.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-406886952460947306' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/406886952460947306' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1008395888"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 24, 2012 at 10:28 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5056317962112688606</id><published>2012-08-24T10:57:07.005-06:00</published><updated>2012-08-24T10:57:07.005-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Both Gerry Spence and Paul Harvey were credits to ...</title><content type='html'>Both Gerry Spence and Paul Harvey were credits to their professions during the Randy Weaver saga.  Probably the only reasons Weaver didn&amp;#39;t end up dead or buried in a Federal prison for the rest of his life.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/406886952460947306/comments/default/5056317962112688606'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/406886952460947306/comments/default/5056317962112688606'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/ruby-ridge-age-of-state-terrorism-begins.html?showComment=1345827427005#c5056317962112688606' title=''/><author><name>Chris Mallory</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/ruby-ridge-age-of-state-terrorism-begins.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-406886952460947306' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/406886952460947306' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1169798158"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 24, 2012 at 10:57 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1911309557187216231</id><published>2012-08-24T10:46:29.677-06:00</published><updated>2012-08-24T10:46:29.677-06:00</updated><title type='text'>This is so incredibly sad. It really makes you won...</title><content type='html'>This is so incredibly sad. It really makes you wonder how many people will sell their souls for the system that turns us into slaves- just so they can get better scraps than the rest of us- while protecting the billionaires who want to destroy truth, knowledge, love, and life, because it threatens their greed-blinded egos.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;All I can think to make myself feel better is that in my life I have experienced many times that Karma is real, and