liberated by a Circuit Court Judge, August 22, 2012, as we all know now.  Tying up loose ends, and trying to make the FBI look proactive; following the false flag Aurora theater shooting, right guys? That whole scenario of one lone shooter named James Holmes has fallen pretty flat. The rats are scurrying.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/406886952460947306/comments/default/9208684781280303672'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/406886952460947306/comments/default/9208684781280303672'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/ruby-ridge-age-of-state-terrorism-begins.html?showComment=1345816132194#c9208684781280303672' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/ruby-ridge-age-of-state-terrorism-begins.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-406886952460947306' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/406886952460947306' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1311301644"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 24, 2012 at 7:48 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7557060249000717976</id><published>2012-08-23T18:58:40.374-06:00</published><updated>2012-08-23T18:58:40.374-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Just another case where people are deep-sixed in o...</title><content type='html'>Just another case where people are deep-sixed in order to tie up any loose strings.  How many times and in how many other cases was the same done?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.co